  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes:\n      - Optimized Session Transport to completely eliminate session leaks and zombie sessions.\n      - Implemented a \"Self-Cleaning\" architecture using bitwise AND masking for ultra-fast session registry recycling.\n      - Adopted atomic Interlocked.Exchange to flush stale connections and drastically reduce GC pressure.\n      - Improved memory resilience under high-traffic storm requests by decoupling session lifecycles from business logic.\n      - Automated hardware-aware thresholds to ensure peak performance across different CPU core counts.",
